{{!--
  ICON CLOUD SECTION
  Rotating sphere of toolkit logos (assets in /content/images/toolkit).
  Auto-rotates; drag to spin with momentum; tap a logo for a small emoji
  celebration burst. See icon-cloud.js for the projection math and
  icon-cloud.css for the sprite styling.

  Hardcoded logo list, same convention as logos-scroll.hbs: Ghost templates
  cannot glob a filesystem directory, so each <img> is a manual entry
  matching what's actually in /content/images/toolkit. Add a new logo by
  adding one .icon-cloud-item block here — the JS distributes however many
  items exist evenly across the sphere with no count-specific tuning needed.
--}}

